## Web Application API Discovery
To find hidden API paths, execute this terminal pipeline to gather historical URLs, scrape JavaScript files, and brute-force directories.

# 1. Gather all historical URLs from the Wayback Machine and AlienVault
echo "target.com" | gau | grep -E "\.json|\/api\/|\/v[0-9]\/" > api_urls.txt
# 2. Extract endpoints hidden inside JavaScript files# Download target JS files first, then run LinkFinder
python3 linkfinder.py -i https://target.com -o cli
# 3. Fuzz for hidden API documentation and routes using SecLists
ffuf -u https://target.com -w /path/to/SecLists/Discovery/Web-Content/api-endpoints.txt -mc 200,204,301,302,401,403

