## Cloud Infrastructure Discovery
To map out the target's cloud perimeter, execute this pipeline to discover subdomains, check for active hosts, and search for exposed cloud assets on Shodan.

# 1. Passive and active subdomain orchestration
subfinder -d target.com -o subdomains.txt
# 2. Filter out dead hosts and find active web servers
cat subdomains.txt | httpx -title -tech-detect -status-code -o active_hosts.txt
# 3. CLI search for infrastructure leaks via Shodan (Requires Shodan API Key)
shodan search "ssl:'target.com' port:443" --fields ip_str,port,org

